; inland transportation and logistics services; port operation and management services; telecommunication and networking services; as well as ship-to-ship operations. The company was formerly known as Straits Inter Logistics Berhad and changed its name to Straits Energy Resources Berhad in August 2021. Straits Energy Resources Berhad was incorporated in 1996 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Straits Energy Resources Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚提供石油贸易和加油服务。公司前身为 Straits Inter Logistics Berhad，于2021年8月更名为现名，成立于1996年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。","lines":["加油服务：为油轮、集装箱船、货船、邮轮和渡轮等船舶提供船用燃料，包括岸上设施到船舶的岸对船加油和船舶之间的船对船加油。","海事物流、船舶管理和船务代理服务：提供海事物流、船舶管理及船务代理服务。","内陆运输和物流服务：提供内陆运输和物流服务。","港口运营和管理服务：提供港口运营和管理服务。","电信和网络服务及船对船作业：提供电信和网络服务以及船对船作业服务。"],"lines_en":["Bunkering services: Provision of marine fuels to ships and ocean-faring vessels, including onshore bunkering (shore-to-ship) and offshore bunkering (ship-to-ship).","Marine logistics, ship management, and shipping agency services: Provision of marine logistics, ship management, and shipping agency services.","Inland transportation and logistics services: Provision of inland transportation and logistics services.","Port operation and management services: Provision of port operation and management services.","Telecommunication and networking services and ship-to-ship operations: Provision of telecommunication and networking services and ship-to-ship operations."]}}